// The user specified total length 120, so there is an extra 30 mm.
// The given grip/transition/gauge lengths do not add up to total_length.
// As per the user's explicit dimensions, I will model the parts as stated
// and place them along X starting at -total_length/2, which leaves gaps.
// (If the intent was a solid dog bone, the grip_length or transition should
// be increased by 15 mm total. That would change the stated dimensions, so
// I am not doing that here.)

